    "description": {
      "en": "Original low-poly direction: establish open-ended tubular carapace, oversized spherical eyes and a three-bladed tail in the blockout, then preserve the largest silhouette breaks and openings. Simplify fine ornament and repeated elements without copying reference meshes; palette and presentation are artistic choices, not fossil evidence.",
      "zh": "原创低多边形方向：先以两端开口筒甲、大球眼与三叶尾搭建体块，再保留主要外轮廓转折与孔隙。细纹及重复结构可简化，不复制参考网格；配色与展示方式属于美术选择，并非化石证据。"
    },
