    "preview": "assets/additions/odaraia/small-life-round10-20261018/preview.webp",
    "quality_status": "independent_qa_accepted_stylized_prop",
    "reconstruction_notes": {
      "en": "Original living whole-organism interpretation: soft internal trunk and short projecting head enclosed by a naturally tapered tube carapace open at both ends, proportionate large paired eyes, simplified internal paddles and a connected telson with two lateral blades plus one vertical blade. Nominal0.1m tube/body scale, muted palette and static pose are art choices. No closed bivalve capsule, lateral long-spine substitute, reused Dollocaris/Isoxys mesh, exact segment/limb count, fine head-organ or swimming-mechanism claim. Closed semantic roots overlap organically while shell apertures remain actual geometry.",
      "zh": "原创全体生活复原：柔软内躯与短前伸头部包于自然渐收、两端开口的筒甲中，具比例克制的大型双眼、简化内侧桨肢，以及两侧各一叶和一片竖叶组成的相连三叶尾。0.1米名义筒甲/体尺度、柔和配色及静姿为美术设定。不做封闭双瓣囊甲或长侧刺替代，不复用Dollocaris/Isoxys网格，不主张精确体节/肢数、细小头器官或游泳机制。封闭语义部件在根部自然交叠，筒甲孔口保留真实几何。"
    },
    "reconstruction_type": "whole-organism",
    "representation": "living-reconstruction",
    "scientific_scope": {
      "en": "Independently reviewed original stylized-inspired static teaching art. Palette, pose, nominal dimensions and simplified anatomy are artistic choices; not a strict scientific reconstruction or coexistence claim.",
      "zh": "通过独立审查的原创静态风格化启发教学美术；配色、姿态、名义尺寸及简化解剖属于美术选择，不作严格科学复原或同域共存主张。"
